# {{.ID}} (Pyro plugin)

A JavaScript plugin: `plugin.js` is the whole plugin and there is nothing to build.
`pyro.d.ts` describes the `pyro` global so your editor can complete it.

Install it, and reinstall on every save (a running `pyro serve` picks changes up):

    pyro plugin dev .

Try one call without installing:
{{if eq .Kind "protocol"}}
    pyro plugin test . --url {{.ID}}://localhost:1234 --body hello
{{else if eq .Kind "auth"}}
    pyro plugin test . --url https://api.example.com/orders --body '{}' --param secret=s3cret
{{else}}
    pyro plugin test . --phase post --status 200
{{end}}
Package for sharing (prints the sha256 for an index entry):

    pyro plugin pack .

See docs/plugins.md in the Pyro repository for the API.
